thub.com/repos/libgeos/geos/issues/1530","id":5829085530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOACh1KM8AAAABW3DJWg","user":{"login":"strk","id":289678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTY3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk","html_url":"https://github.com/strk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/strk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T08:06:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:06:47Z","body":"See what relate says:\n> geosop -a 0102000020A2100000030000005163B45884333540352259FDE66A51406043FEC3BA333540C0BFF081E66A5140831D215B88333540107B41F4E66A5140 -b 0102000020A210000002000000685E205B88333540B7363CF4E66A5140831D215B88333540107B41F4E66A5140 -c relate\nFF1F00102\n\nThat's:\n  Interior-Interior: no intersection (F)\n  Interior-Boundary: no intersection (F)\n  Interior-Exterior: linear intersection (1)\n  Boundary-Interior: no intersection (F)\n  Boundary-Boundary: puntual intersection (0)\n  Boundary-Exterior: puntual intersection (0)\n  Exterior-Interior: linear intersection (1)\n  Exterior-Boundary: puntual intersection (0)\n  Exterior-Exterior: areal intersection (2)\n\nWhere's the cross ? If there was a cross we'd have Interior-Interior intersection being 0 or 1, not F as RelateOp reports.\n\nSo we either have a bug in LineMerger OR we have it in RelateOp.\n\n@dr-jts what's your take ?\n","author_association":